sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Caller as Integration / Tests
    participant Facade as Thin backend facade
    participant ISA as Single build_isa(is_pic)
    participant Planner as Shared compile-plan / context builder
    participant Core as Shared per-function compile primitive
    participant FC as compiler::FnCompiler
    participant Cache as Cache facade
    participant CacheCore as Canonical cache API only
    participant Tests as Local module tests + crate-level orchestration tests

    Caller->>Facade: compile request (JIT or Object)
    Facade->>ISA: build_isa(mode)
    Facade->>Planner: build CompilePlan / CompileContext once
    loop each defn
        Planner->>Core: compile_defn(plan, defn)
        Core->>FC: compile_body
    end
    Facade-->>Caller: artifacts / pointers / object output

    Caller->>Cache: cache operations
    Cache->>CacheCore: SymbolTable-direct canonical API

    Tests->>FC: narrow unit tests near owning modules
    Tests->>Facade: only crate-level orchestration / end-to-end coverage
